"7615",""
"7616","that Muʿādh b. Jabal planned to go on a journey, so he said, ""O Messenger of Allah ﷺ, ˹please˺ give me some advice."" He said, ""Worship Allah and do not associate anything with Him."" Muʿādh said, ""O Messenger of Allah, ˹please give me more advice.˺"" He said, ""When you have done something bad, then ˹follow it up with˺ doing good."" Muʿādh said, ""O Messenger of Allah, ˹please give me more advice.˺."" The Prophet said, ""Be steadfast ˹in these˺ and improve your character.""[^1]"
