"7670","ʿAbdullāh b. ʿAbbās met ʿAbdullāh b. al-ʿĀs and he asked Ibn ʿAbbās: Which āyah in the Book of Allah is the most hopeful to you? He said: ""Say, ""O My servants who have transgressed against themselves [by sinning], do not despair of the mercy of Allah."" (Zumar 39:53). Then he said: But the statement of Ibrāhīm ""Do you not believe? He said, Indeed, but I wanted to satisfy my heart."" (Baqarah 2:260)"
